### crear con datos invalidos (espera 422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/cliente
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre_completo": "",
    "correo": "no-es-un-correo"
}

### mostrar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/cliente/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### mostrar inexistente (espera 404)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/cliente/9999
